architecture web-address-edge
  canonical_name WebAddressEdge
  family forwarding
  domain Web / Address carrier
  layer edge
  semantic_question How does an ordinary HTTPS host and path enter Bonfyre's address fabric without turning Nginx into semantic or authority machinery?
  purpose A native WebAddress compiler plus Nginx and Cloudflare Tunnel carriers. It normalizes a controlled host, carries path and request context, exposes an explicit discovery document, and asks AddressPlane/Matrix for an active, disclosure-constrained presence.
  maturity implemented
  source_path cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/connections_workspace.h
  source_path scripts/release/public_surface_rollout.mjs
