  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/auth_surface_test.sh proves an ungranted Pro session cannot enter JRSS, a JRSS read grant cannot mutate, and revoke closes an existing session immediately
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/private_estate_surface_test.sh proves a native role/scope closure is HTML-only, compiles private Studio from native review work plus closure-derived CMS/ForeignTwin carriers rather than generic Studio, creates bounded WorkGraph review work, creates a real CMS row in a closure-derived JRSS namespace, observes a public fixture into a receipt/body root private:jrss:stable:cedar, refuses a forged cross-client form, suppresses private RO-Crate/discovery paths, refuses the JRSS row from the separately admitted AI Loss CMS namespace, revokes independently from client admission, and compiles one Upper90 leadership closure through the JRSS, AI Loss, and Leads host selectors without child/sibling leakage
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/auth_surface_test.sh compiles CRM Deal metadata into a safe native schema and exercises its authenticated HTMX create/update/list path, including cross-account namespace refusal
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/auth_surface_test.sh proves a free signup receives only self scope, creates and resolves its actor-owned Life PersonalProfile plus a private PhysicalCarrier recipe and actor-private ForeignTwin receipt/body, proves its actor-owned HTML/RO-Crate paths are anonymously refused but self-readable, sees only that recipe in its CMS HTMX closure, and remains refused from market territory and Frappe-derived CMS grammar
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/auth_surface_test.sh proves a paid but ungranted account is refused from /studio/admin, then a current bonfyre/admin grant admits the private noindex repair room, changes a fixture user's tier and immediately refuses the stale token, grants/revokes Leads admission, explicitly burns active sessions through BonfyreAuth, and cannot leak that room to the JRSS host
