  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/people_static_manifest_test.sh proves native text/NUL manifests for source-bound credited names, long coordinates, Unicode, embedded NUL, and an independently hashed golden key; a direct native/legacy comparison matched before the default witness retired its Python dependency, and scripts/tests/people_ledger_static_export_test.sh proves the exporter materializes the directory and all three exact query leaves without Python
