  invariant slow first byte, slow load, slow same-origin resources and outreach-sample links on a public front are recorded with each rollout and by the live sweep, but do not by themselves stop activation
  invariant the edge sweep covers every published subdomain page: locally, that each one links only sheets and scripts the upload carries; live, one slow request per host and one per linked house sheet, with the Worker's 429 cap counted rather than read as a broken page
  invariant the live sweep keeps one operator goal per open defect class and host (source live-sweep), blocked for rendering failures and slow loads so they reach the owner's activity panel and inbox through the account work index, and resolves a goal when the next sweep no longer finds it; it never repairs, publishes or rolls out
