  forbidden_inference a passing front probe -> a good-looking or usable page; it names known failure classes and reads only the anonymous front, so signed-in renders and pages behind the fronts are not covered
  forbidden_inference a resolved live-sweep goal -> the defect was fixed by someone; it means the last sweep did not see it, which a 429 or an unreachable host can also cause
