  known_gap the scheduled sweep is a launchd template in services/live-sweep; it runs only once it is loaded
  forbidden_inference a deployed edge page -> fresh material; the pages are as fresh as the archive and subject fabric they were composed from
  source_path cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/site_mcp.c
  invariant site offer --ask FACT=Question stores up to eight intake questions in the offer's projection_contract (fact names a-z0-9_, refused on a malformed, repeated or ninth question with nothing kept); the contact page asks them only when ?about= names that published offer, and the message records only answers to that offer's own questions, keyed by fact, beside the about subject
  witness 2026-10-30 cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/site_offer_intake_test.sh (built in a scratch copy, run by site-product-witness) passes: malformed, non-slug, repeated and ninth questions refused with no record left; a range in words is not read as an amount; the form for an offer asks its questions with markup escaped, the plain, made-up-subject and question-free forms ask none; an answer for an unasked fact, a blank answer and an answer under another offer's subject are dropped; site inbox shows answers in JSON and text
  forbidden_inference an intake answer -> a verified fact about the person's system; it is what the person typed, and the brief's inventory rule (subject, scope and grant) still governs anything treated as inventory
  known_gap intake answers reach the owner's inbox only; they are not yet turned into a draft inventory for bonfyre-brief cited, and assistants' send_inquiry and request_booking carry no answers
  known_gap site_product_test.sh stops at "search by words" on 2026-10-30 with both the pre-change binary and the scratch build, so that failure predates the intake change and is not yet diagnosed


interaction migration-brief-types-price-practice-site
  source cmd-brief
  destination web-address-edge
  relation estimate_ranges_and_needed_facts_become_site_offers
  preserves each brief type's estimate low, high and unit as a range worded "Estimated $L to $H per UNIT", and the brief type's needs facts as the names of the offer's intake questions
  drops the estimate as an amount (no range becomes a price number), the brief's citations and receipts, and any inventory status
  forbidden_inference a range on the practice site -> a quote, a calibrated price or the owner's approval of that price
  forbidden_inference a built practice site -> a published one; it lives in a site home on loopback until its owner runs site share or a publish
  witness cmd/BonfyreBrief/tests/practice_site_test.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreBrief/practice-site/build.sh
  binding cmd/BonfyreBrief/data/migration-brief-types.json

interaction web-address-edge-forwards-context
  source web-address-edge
  destination address-plane
