  preserves canonical host, path, requested world, audience, and representation as a bounded address-resolution request
  drops TLS termination, HTTP transport, WebSocket transport, and any edge-cache implementation from semantic resolution
  forbidden_inference an edge-forwarded URL -> read, effect, claim, or publication authority
