interaction mcp-resolves-native-matrix-address
  source web-address-edge
  destination bonfyre-matrix
  relation config-gated-native-address-cut
  preserves normalized host, path, requested world, audience, representation, configured native-owner identity, native resolution receipt, and the subject's already-bound constellation only
  drops actor/session selection, delegation envelopes, information-policy closure, credential/private-key material, arbitrary remote command/database selection, evidence promotion, provider/resource state, financial commitment, and all effect authority
  forbidden_inference an MCP address result -> a complete viewer closure, private-read right, publication decision, economic state, provider availability, or authority to act
  invalidates_on configured Matrix store identity, native WebAddress resolution contract, constellation binding, or MCP argument-validation contract changes
