  witness 2026-08-30 local MCP Matrix-resolution used the bounded configured Oracle native owner read route and resolved aurekai.live/ to institution:aurekai:live
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/project_native.test.mjs verifies configured store selection and POSIX quoting across the SSH remote-shell boundary without invoking remote effects
  binding integrations/mcp/project_native.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c

interaction web-address-edge-admits-delegated-estate
  source web-address-edge
  destination authority-graph
  relation exact_revocable_institution_admission
  preserves exact controlled host-to-institution binding, current session validity, required read-or-write role, grant revocation/expiry, and original request method only
  drops public machine-carrier publication, any cross-client data closure, global subscription tier as a substitute for client authority, credentials, generic host wildcards, provider/model/effect authority, and all semantic state from the Nginx edge
  forbidden_inference a generic authenticated session -> delegated client access
  invalidates_on institution grant state, session state, exact host binding, or request method changes
