  binding cmd/BonfyreAuth/src/main.c
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c
  binding deploy/nginx/aurekai-surfaces.conf

interaction protected-estate-host-gates-authority
  source web-address-edge
  destination authority-graph
  relation host_selected_reversible_institution_admission
  preserves exact protected host, fixed institution selector, bearer validity, current grant role, original request verb class, revocation/expiry result, and the decision receipt only
  drops client application state, generic subscription tier as a substitute for a grant, any cross-client closure, Matrix public discovery, machine carrier projection, effect authority beyond the admitted verb, and all credential material
