  binding cmd/BonfyreAuth/src/main.c
  binding cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/main.c
  binding deploy/nginx/aurekai-surfaces.conf

interaction mcp-compiles-institutional-slice
  source web-address-edge
  destination institutional-product-contracts
  relation oauth-session-to-live-delegated-tool-slice
  preserves current OAuth session, verified BonfyreAuth identity, exact/ancestral institution admission, native Upper90 role scope, declared CMS owner grammar, ForeignTwin observation boundary, and bounded review-work contract only
  drops global project source tree/tools, sibling/child data not in the closure, caller-selected namespace, public machine publication, raw credentials, private body enumeration, and all authority not owned by each invoked native tool
