  binding cmd/BonfyreUpper90/src/main.c

interaction mcp-compiles-self-slice
  source web-address-edge
  destination bonfyre-matrix
  relation oauth-session-to-actor-local-tool-slice
  preserves the verified actor identity, exact native self scope, actor-local CMS namespace, fixed Life/self coordinates, and private ForeignTwin root derived from the same actor
  drops the global project owner, generic write inference, institutional/parent/child closures, another actor namespace/root, public profile publication, public ForeignTwin projection, payment/device/provider authority, and every external effect
  forbidden_inference OAuth read/write transport admission for a self account -> generic write, Bonfyre superuser access, an institutional slice, another actor's CMS/ForeignTwin state, publication, or effect authority
  invalidates_on native session/self-scope verification, actor identity, actor namespace/root mapping, MCP self-tool contract, or superuser routing changes
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/oauth_institution_slice_test.sh proves a free self account initializes only bonfyre-self-slice, sees self closure/carrier/private-ForeignTwin tools, and receives neither institutional nor global project tools
  binding integrations/mcp/bonfyre_oauth_gateway.mjs
  binding cmd/BonfyreAuth/src/main.c
